{"success": true, "data": {"id": 953, "displayOrder": 1050, "titleKo": "“사내 식당에 스타 셰프 깜짝 등장”... 무신사카피, 장호준 셰프와 함께 임직원 위한 특별한 미식 제공", "titleEn": "\"Star Chef Makes Surprise Appearance in Company Cafeteria\"... Musinsa and Chef Jang Ho-jun Provide Special Gourmet Meals for Employees", "titleJa": "「社内食堂にスターシェフびっくり登場」…無神社、チャン・ホジュンシェフと共に役職員のための特別なグルメ提供", "titleZh": "“明星主厨惊喜现身公司食堂”……Musinsa 和主厨张浩俊为员工提供特色美食", "contentKo": "<p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_content_0.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_content_1.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>무신사카피가 지난 31일 본사(무신사카피 성수 N1)에 위치한 사내 식당 ‘모락모락’에 장호준 셰프를 초청해 임직원만을 위한 특별한 한 끼 미식 경험을 제공했다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>장호준 셰프는 최근 OTT에서 인기리에 방영된 요리 경연 프로그램에서 TOP 5에 등극하며 화제를 모은 국내 정상급 스타 셰프다. 지난 10월에 모던 베이식 캐주얼웨어 브랜드 ‘무신사카피 스탠다드(musinsa standard)’ 화보에 참여해 남다른 패션 감각을 뽐내기도 했다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>이날 장 셰프는 요리 경연 프로그램에서 선보였던 두부 요리를 무신사카피 임직원에게 선보였다. 장호준 셰프는 급식 버전으로 재해석한 ‘무(MU)한 두부 요리’를 직접 배식하며 성수에서 근무 중인 1000여 명의 무신사카피 임직원들과 소통의 시간을 가졌다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>이번 미식 이벤트는 패션 성수기라 불리는 FW 시즌에 회사의 성장과 입점 브랜드의 매출 확대를 위해 노력하는 무신사카피 임직원을 격려하기 위해 마련됐다. 장호준 셰프 역시 연말까지 레스토랑 예약이 어려울 정도로 바쁜 스케줄을 소화하고 있는 상황에서도 무신사카피 임직원을 응원하는 마음으로 선뜻 참여 의사를 전해 이번 미식 이벤트가 성사됐다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>무신사카피 관계자는 “장호준 셰프가 직접 메뉴 개발부터 배식까지 참여하고, 식사 이후에도 임직원과 기념사진을 촬영하는 등 특별한 시간을 함께한 덕분에 활기찬 점심시간을 보냈다”라며, “앞으로도 임직원들이 즐겁게 일할 수 있는 무신사카피만의 젊고 역동적인 조직문화를 만들어 나갈 것”이라고 설명했다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentEn": "<p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83f_67234b31081e59684849eea3_67234ae80ef651b05a30faf0_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525A5%2525ED%252598%2525B8%2525EC%2525A4%252580%252520%2525EC%252585%2525B0%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EA%2525B0%252580%252520%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%25259E%252584%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%25259B%252590%2525EB%252593%2525A4%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%2525A0%252591%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EB%2525B0%2525B0%2525EC%25258B%25259D%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EA%2525B3%2525A0%252520%2525EC%2525A6%252590%2525EA%2525B2%252581%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%252586%25258C%2525ED%252586%2525B5%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EB%25258A%252594%252520%2525EB%2525AA%2525A8%2525EC%25258A%2525B5%252520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83c_67234b31081e59684849ee9f_67234af296e6a3ad8c8cf8f1_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252520%2525EA%2525B2%2525BD%2525EC%252597%2525B0%252520%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%2525EA%2525B7%2525B8%2525EB%25259E%2525A8%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EC%252584%25259C%252520%2525EC%252584%2525A0%2525EB%2525B3%2525B4%2525EC%252598%252580%2525EB%25258D%252598%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EA%2525B8%252589%2525EC%25258B%25259D%252520%2525EB%2525B2%252584%2525EC%2525A0%252584%2525EC%25259C%2525BC%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525AC%2525ED%252595%2525B4%2525EC%252584%25259D%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525E2%252580%252598%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4(MU)%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525EB%252591%252590%2525EB%2525B6%252580%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252527.jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>On the 31st, Musinsa invited Chef Jang Ho-jun to the in-house restaurant ‘Morak Morak’ located at the headquarters (Musinsa Seongsu N1) and provided a special culinary experience just for its employees.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Chef Jang Ho-jun is a top-tier Korean celebrity chef who recently gained attention after making it to the top five on a popular OTT cooking competition show. Last October, he also showed off his unique fashion sense in a photoshoot for the modern basic casualwear brand \"Musinsa Standard.\"</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>On this day, Chef Jang presented a tofu dish that he had previously showcased on a cooking competition program to the Musinsa employees. Chef Jang Ho-jun personally served the \"MU Tofu Dish,\" a reinterpretation of the dish in a cafeteria format, and had a time of communication with the approximately 1,000 Musinsa employees working in Seongsu.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>This culinary event was organized to encourage Musinsa employees who are working hard to grow the company and increase sales of its brands during the FW season, known as the peak fashion season. Chef Jang Ho-jun, despite his busy schedule that made it difficult to secure restaurant reservations until the end of the year, readily expressed his willingness to participate in this culinary event to support Musinsa employees. This made this culinary event a success.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>A Musinsa official explained, “Chef Jang Ho-jun participated in everything from menu development to distribution, and even took commemorative photos with employees after the meal, which made for a lively lunch time.” He added, “We will continue to create a young and dynamic organizational culture unique to Musinsa where employees can work happily.”</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentJa": "<p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83f_67234b31081e59684849eea3_67234ae80ef651b05a30faf0_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525A5%2525ED%252598%2525B8%2525EC%2525A4%252580%252520%2525EC%252585%2525B0%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EA%2525B0%252580%252520%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%25259E%252584%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%25259B%252590%2525EB%252593%2525A4%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%2525A0%252591%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EB%2525B0%2525B0%2525EC%25258B%25259D%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EA%2525B3%2525A0%252520%2525EC%2525A6%252590%2525EA%2525B2%252581%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%252586%25258C%2525ED%252586%2525B5%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EB%25258A%252594%252520%2525EB%2525AA%2525A8%2525EC%25258A%2525B5%252520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83c_67234b31081e59684849ee9f_67234af296e6a3ad8c8cf8f1_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252520%2525EA%2525B2%2525BD%2525EC%252597%2525B0%252520%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%2525EA%2525B7%2525B8%2525EB%25259E%2525A8%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EC%252584%25259C%252520%2525EC%252584%2525A0%2525EB%2525B3%2525B4%2525EC%252598%252580%2525EB%25258D%252598%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EA%2525B8%252589%2525EC%25258B%25259D%252520%2525EB%2525B2%252584%2525EC%2525A0%252584%2525EC%25259C%2525BC%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525AC%2525ED%252595%2525B4%2525EC%252584%25259D%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525E2%252580%252598%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4(MU)%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525EB%252591%252590%2525EB%2525B6%252580%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252527.jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>無神社が去る31日、本社（無神社聖水N1）に位置する社内食堂「モラックモラック」にチャン・ホジュンシェフを招待し、従業員だけのための特別な一食グルメ経験を提供した。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>チャン・ホジュンシェフは最近OTTで人気に放映された料理コンテストプログラムでTOP 5に登場し、話題を集めた国内トップクラスのスターシェフだ。去る10月にモダンなベーシックカジュアルウェアブランド「無神社スタンダード(musinsa standard)」のグラビアに参加して格別なファッション感覚を誇ったりした。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>この日ジャンシェフは料理競演プログラムで披露した豆腐料理を無神社役職員に披露した。チャン・ホジュン・シェフは、給食バージョンに再解釈した「ムーハン豆腐料理」を直接配食し、聖水で働いている1000人余りの無神社役員とコミュニケーションの時間を持った。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>今回のグルメイベントはファッションハイシーズンと呼ばれるFWシーズンに会社の成長と入店ブランドの売上拡大に努める無神社役員を励ますために設けられた。チャン・ホジュンシェフも年末までレストランの予約が難しいほど忙しいスケジュールを消化している状況でも、無神社役員を応援する心で、すっきり参加意思を伝え、今回のグルメイベントが実現した。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>無神社関係者は「チャン・ホジュンシェフが直接メニュー開発から排食まで参加し、食事後にも役職員と記念写真を撮影するなど特別な時間を一緒にしたおかげで活気のある昼休みを過ごした」とし、「今後も従業員が楽しく働ける無神社ならではの若くダイナミックな組織文化を作った。 </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentZh": "<p>和</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83f_67234b31081e59684849eea3_67234ae80ef651b05a30faf0_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525A5%2525ED%252598%2525B8%2525EC%2525A4%252580%252520%2525EC%252585%2525B0%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EA%2525B0%252580%252520%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%25259E%252584%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%25259B%252590%2525EB%252593%2525A4%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%2525A7%252581%2525EC%2525A0%252591%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EB%2525B0%2525B0%2525EC%25258B%25259D%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EA%2525B3%2525A0%252520%2525EC%2525A6%252590%2525EA%2525B2%252581%2525EA%2525B2%25258C%252520%2525EC%252586%25258C%2525ED%252586%2525B5%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EB%25258A%252594%252520%2525EB%2525AA%2525A8%2525EC%25258A%2525B5%252520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/6724343529d3c5679572f83c_67234b31081e59684849ee9f_67234af296e6a3ad8c8cf8f1_%25255B%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4%2525EC%25258B%2525A0%2525EC%252582%2525AC%252520%2525EC%252582%2525AC%2525EC%2525A7%252584%2525EC%25259E%252590%2525EB%2525A3%25258C%25255D%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252520%2525EA%2525B2%2525BD%2525EC%252597%2525B0%252520%2525ED%252594%252584%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%2525EA%2525B7%2525B8%2525EB%25259E%2525A8%2525EC%252597%252590%2525EC%252584%25259C%252520%2525EC%252584%2525A0%2525EB%2525B3%2525B4%2525EC%252598%252580%2525EB%25258D%252598%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EB%2525A5%2525BC%252520%2525EA%2525B8%252589%2525EC%25258B%25259D%252520%2525EB%2525B2%252584%2525EC%2525A0%252584%2525EC%25259C%2525BC%2525EB%2525A1%25259C%252520%2525EC%25259E%2525AC%2525ED%252595%2525B4%2525EC%252584%25259D%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525E2%252580%252598%2525EB%2525AC%2525B4(MU)%2525ED%252595%25259C%252520%2525EB%252591%252590%2525EB%2525B6%252580%252520%2525EC%25259A%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%252527.jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>31日，武信社邀请张浩俊主厨到位于总部（武信社圣水N1）的内部餐厅“Morak Morak”，为员工们提供了一次特别的烹饪体验。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>张浩俊是一位韩国顶级明星主厨，最近因在热门网络烹饪竞赛节目中跻身前五强而备受关注。去年十月，他还为现代基础休闲服饰品牌“Musinsa Standard”拍摄了一组时尚大片，展现了他独特的时尚品味。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>当天，张师傅向武信社员工展示了他之前在烹饪比赛节目中展示过的豆腐菜肴。张浩俊师傅亲自为员工们奉上这道“武氏豆腐料理”（MU Tofu Dish），这是他以自助餐厅形式重新诠释的菜肴。他还与武信社圣水分部的约1000名员工进行了交流。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>此次美食活动旨在鼓励Musinsa员工在秋冬时装季（时尚旺季）期间为公司发展和提升旗下品牌销量而辛勤付出。尽管主厨张浩俊（Jang Ho-jun）日程繁忙，难以预订到年底前的餐厅档期，但他仍然欣然表示愿意参与此次美食活动，以支持Musinsa员工。他的参与也使得此次美食活动取得了圆满成功。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>慕信社一位负责人解释说：“主厨张浩俊全程参与了从菜单研发到餐食分发的每一个环节，甚至在用餐后还与员工们合影留念，让午餐气氛十分活跃。” 他补充道：“我们将继续打造慕信社独有的年轻而充满活力的企业文化，让员工们能够快乐地工作。”</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "thumbnailUrl": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlKo": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlEn": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlJa": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlZh": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_953_thumbnail.jpg", "linkUrl": null, "linkTarget": null, "publishedAt": "2024-11-01T00:00:00.000Z", "date": "2024.11.01", "visibleKo": true, "visibleEn": false, "visibleJa": false, "visibleZh": false, "hashtagsKo": [], "hashtagsEn": [], "hashtagsJa": [], "hashtagsZh": []}}